usly restored 18th-century olive mill. This serene estate offers an authentic escape, blending rustic charm with refined comfort. Guests can immerse themselves in culinary traditions, explore picturesque vineyards, and find inspiration amidst rolling hills.","tags":["The Creative Retreat","Remote Sanctuary","Creative Retreat","Historic Estate","Tuscan Charm","Culinary Experience","Vineyard Hotel"],"whyFits":["The Draw: Discover authentic Tuscan tranquility and artistic inspiration within a beautifully restored olive mill and vineyard estate.","The Flex: Engage in immersive cooking classes utilizing estate-grown produce, delving deep into regional culinary secrets."],"tradeoff":null,"amenities":["Outdoor Pool","Cooking Classes","Fine Dining Restaurant","Extensive Gardens","Vineyard Access","Olive Oil Tastings","Wine Cellar"],"settings":["Historic","Rural","Vineyard","Hilltop","Secluded","Countryside"],"surroundings":"LaChiusa is set amidst 100 acres of rolling Tuscan hills, olive groves, and vineyards, offering panoramic views of the Val d'Orcia. It provides a peaceful base for exploring charming medieval villages like Montefollonico, Pienza, and Montepulciano.","timeZone":"CET (Central European Time)","bookingWindow":"3-6 months in advance, especially for summer and autumn stays due to its popularity.","guestSummary":"Guests consistently rave about the authentic Tuscan experience, the exceptional estate-to-table cuisine, and the warm, personalized hospitality. Some note that a car is essential for exploring the beautiful, remote surroundings.","bookingUrl":"https://www.booking.com/hotel/it/la-chiusa-montefollonico-torrita-di-siena.sv.html?aid=311984&label=la-chiusa-montefollonico-torrita-di-siena-6Wp9QFe2HX_UqHCfu7l6WQS541197049382%3Apl%3Ata%3Ap1%3Ap2%3Aac%3Aap%3Aneg%3Afi%3Atikwd-2296838528558%3Alp9062456%3Ali%3Adec%3Adm%3Appccp%3DUmFuZG9tSVYkc2RlIyh9YTQUGSsRwx9_3qo3uPTHyoo&sid=a046e38c1a35194e6f1caf99e85173ca&dest_id=-122323&dest_type=city&dist=0&group_adults=2&gro