],"settings":["Adults-only","Design-led","Vibrant","Retro-chic","Social hub"],"surroundings":"Located in San Antonio Bay, the hotel is a short walk from sandy beaches and a quick drive to the lively nightlife of San Antonio, while offering easy access to Ibiza's renowned sunset spots.","timeZone":"CET (Central European Time)","bookingWindow":"3-6 months in advance","guestSummary":"Guests rave about the hotel's unique aesthetic, vibrant atmosphere, and excellent poolside experience. Some note that the lively environment can occasionally lead to a bit of noise.","bookingUrl":"https://www.booking.com/hotel/es/paradiso-ibiza-art.sv.html?aid=2276740&label=msn-%2ASsB_l2lGAzTm5xZC1vIvg-80127075804075%3Atikwd-80127263695379%3Aloc-174%3Aneo%3Amte%3Alp153565%3Adec%3Acid578513098%3Aagid1282031125494548%3Aclkid851c732518d2138714e3191f310d0a95&sid=a046e38c1a35194e6f1caf99e85173ca&dest_id=900049991&dest_type=city&dist=0&group_adults=2&group_children=0&hapos=1&hpos=1&no_rooms=1&req_adults=2&req_children=0&room1=A%2CA&sb_price_type=total&sr_order=popularity&srepoch=1782196719&srpvid=05de2eb1a98d0aef&type=total&ucfs=1&","expediaUrl":null,"image2":null,"image3":null,"localGems":{"restaurant1":{"title":"Hostal La Torre","description":"An iconic spot famous for its breathtaking sunset views and delicious Mediterranean tapas, perfect for a relaxed yet chic evening.","affiliateLink":"https://www.thefork.com/restaurant/hostal-la-torre-r67890?aff_id=STITCH"},"restaurant2":{"title":"Cotton Beach Club","description":"Perched on a cliff overlooking Cala Tarida, this stylish beach club offers exquisite Mediterranean fusion cuisine in a glamorous setting.","affiliateLink":"https://www.opentable.com/r/cotton-beach-club-ibiza?aff_id=STITCH"},"restaurant3":{"title":"Café Mambo","description":"A legendary sunset strip venue offering classic cocktails and a lively atmosphere with a menu of international dishes, ideal for pre-party vibes.","affiliateLink":"https://www.thefork.com/restaurant/cafe-mambo-r54321?aff_id=STITCH"},"restaurant4":{"title":"Es Ventall","description":"Experience authentic Ibizan cuisine in a charming, rustic setting. Known for its traditional dishes and excellent service, offering a taste of local culture.","affiliateLink":"https://www.thefork.com/restaurant/es-ventall-r98765?aff_id=STITCH"}},"seasonalPrices":{"autumn":450,"spring":380,"summer":750,"winter":280},"youtubeUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/dQnT902MSk4, https://www.youtube.com/shorts/6GqKaftF7xY, https://www.youtube.com/shorts/iZ6W8ySKiqA, https://www.youtube.com/shorts/MzNxh8nw7xs, https://www.youtube.com/shorts/D1PLBU2CILI","priceTier":"The Accessible Gem (€€)","primaryPersona":"The Social Weekender","primaryBackdrop":"Exclusive Islands","is_locked":true,"updated_at":"2026-06-26T12:34:55.591+00:00"},{"id":"room-mate-gorka","name":"Room Mate Gorka","location":"San Sebastian, Spain","region":"Basque Country, Spain","priceCategory":"€€","priceValue":0,"luxuriousValue":3,"distanceValue":25,"spaScore":2,"image":"[\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/room-mate-gorka/6.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/room-mate-gorka/2.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/room-mate-gorka/3.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/room-mate-gorka/4.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/room-mate-gorka/5.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/room-mate-gorka/1.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/room-mate-gorka/7.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/room-mate-gorka/8.jpg\"]","imageAlt":"Room Mate Gorka","description":"Room Mate Gorka offers a vibrant, modern stay in the heart of San Sebastian. Its playful design and prime location near La Concha beach make it ideal for explorers. Enjoy stylish comfort, steps away from the city's renowned culinary scene and lively pintxos bars. It's a chic base for your Basque adventures.","tags":["The Social Weekender","Boutique","City Break","Modern Design","Central","Gastronomy"],"whyFits":["The Draw: A vibrant, stylish launchpad for social explorers, perfectly positioned amidst San Sebastian's cultural and culinary pulse.","The Flex: Its unique, colorful interiors and welcoming common areas foster a lively atmosphere, serving as a chic social hub."],"tradeoff":null,"amenities":["Free WiFi","Bar","Breakfast Buffet","Fitness Center","24-Hour Front Desk"],"settings":["Urban","City Center","Boutique"],"surroundings":"Nestled in the bustling heart of San Sebastian, Room Mate Gorka is just a short stroll from the iconic La Concha beach, the vibrant Old Town, and the city's premier shopping districts. It offers immediate access to the gastronomic delights the city is famous for.","timeZone":"CET (Central European Time)","bookingWindow":"2-4 months in advance, especially for summer and festival periods.","guestSummary":"Guests consistently rave about the hotel's impeccable modern design, exceptionally friendly staff, and its unbeatable central location. Some note that rooms, while stylish, can be compact.","bookingUrl":"https://www.booking.com/hotel/es/room-mate-gorka.sv.html?aid=304142&label=gen173nr-10CAQoggJCK3NlYXJjaF9yb29tIG1hdGUgZ29ya2Egc2FuIHNlYmFzdGlhbiwgc3BhaW5IM1gEaMgBiAEBmAEzuAEHyAEM2AED6AEB-AEBiAIBqAIBuAK0777RBsACAdICJGZlOGJjZTE1LTY1MzgtNDNiMi1iYzIwLWU2ZDMyNjhmZmU2NtgCAeACAQ&sid=a046e38c1a35194e6f1caf99e85173ca&dist=0&group_adults=2&group_children=0&hapos=1&hpos=1&no_rooms=1&req_adults=2&req_children=0&room1=A%2CA&sb_price_type=total&sr_order=popularity&srepoch=1781512123&srpvid=03f03b9aa2d0038b&type=total&ucfs=1&","expediaUrl":null,"image2":null,"image3":null,"localGems":{"restaurant1":{"title":"Gandarias Jatetxea","description":"A quintessential San Sebastian experience, famous for its succulent solomillo pintxo and lively atmosphere. Perfect for a social evening.","affiliateLink":"https://www.thefork.com/restaurant/gandarias-jatetxea-r2490?aff_id=STITCH"},"restaurant2":{"title":"La Cuchara de San Telmo","description":"Known for its innovative hot pintxos served from the kitchen, offering a modern take on Basque traditions in a bustling setting.","affiliateLink":"https://www.thefork.com/restaurant/la-cuchara-de-san-telmo-r2491?aff_id=STITCH"},"restaurant3":{"title":"Narru Restaurant","description":"Enjoy refined Basque cuisine with a modern twist and sea views, a great spot for a slightly more upscale yet still social dining experience.","affiliateLink":"https://www.thefork.com/restaurant/narru-restaurant-r3380?aff_id=STITCH"},"restaurant4":{"title":"Atari Gastroteka","description":"Located by Santa María Basilica, this lively spot offers excellent pintxos, delicious raciones, and a buzzing terrace ideal for people-watching and socializing.","affiliateLink":"https://www.thefork.com/restaurant/atari-gastroteka-r2500?aff_id=STITCH"}},"seasonalPrices":{"autumn":400,"spring":350,"summer":550,"winter":280},"youtubeUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/o6AjzODYtWU","priceTier":"Boutique (€€)","primaryPersona":"The Social Weekender","primaryBackdrop":"Pristine Shores","is_locked":true,"updated_at":"2026-06-26T12:23:11.946+00:00"},{"id":"grand-hotel-kronenhof","name":"Grand Hotel Kronenhof","location":"Pontresina, Switzerland","region":"Engadin, Swiss Alps","priceCategory":"€€€","priceValue":0,"luxuriousValue":5,"distanceValue":15,"spaScore":5,"image":"[\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/grand-hotel-kronenhof/1.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/grand-hotel-kronenhof/2.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/grand-hotel-kronenhof/3.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/grand-hotel-kronenhof/4.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/grand-hotel-kronenhof/5.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/grand-hotel-kronenhof/6.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/grand-hotel-kronenhof/7.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/grand-hotel-kronenhof/8.jpg\"]","imageAlt":"Grand Hotel Kronenhof","description":"Nestled in the breathtaking Engadin Valley, Grand Hotel Kronenhof is a Neo-Baroque masterpiece. This iconic establishment seamlessly blends historic grandeur with contemporary luxury. Its opulent interiors and world-class service offer an unforgettable Alpine escape, perfect for discerning travelers seeking both relaxation and refined social experiences.","tags":["The Social Weekender","Alpine","Historic","Luxury","Spa","Ski-in/Ski-out (nearby)","Fine Dining","Social Hub","Grand Dame"],"whyFits":["The Draw: Its iconic Neo-Baroque architecture and vibrant social scene make it an irresistible magnet for those seeking glamour amidst Alpine splendor.","The Flex: Boasting one of Switzerland's most magnificent spas, it offers unparalleled rejuvenation after a day on the slopes or hiking trails."],"tradeoff":null,"amenities":["Michelin-starred Dining","Indoor Pool","Outdoor Pool","World-class Spa","Fitness Center","Kids' Club","Valet Parking","Concierge Service","Ski Storage","Boutiques"],"settings":["Neo-Baroque Grandeur","Opulent Interiors","Classic Elegance","Mountain Views","Historic Charm"],"surroundings":"Perched in the picturesque village of Pontresina, the hotel offers direct access to the Engadin's pristine cross-country ski trails and is just moments from the Corviglia ski area. It's surrounded by stunning Alpine scenery, ideal for hiking, biking, and exploring glacial lakes.","timeZone":"CET (Central European Time)","bookingWindow":"6-12 months in advance, especially for peak winter and summer periods.","guestSummary":"Guests consistently rave about the breathtaking Neo-Baroque architecture, world-class spa facilities, and the impeccable, attentive service that anticipates every need. While some might find the classic decor very traditional, the overall experience is overwhelmingly praised for its grandeur and elegance.","bookingUrl":"https://www.booking.com/hotel/ch/grand-kronenhof.sv.html?aid=304142&label=gen173nr-10CAQoggJCNHNlYXJjaF9ncmFuZCBob3RlbCBrcm9uZW5ob2YgcG9udHJlc2luYSwgc3dpdHplcmxhbmRIM1gEaMgBiAEBmAEzuAEHyAEM2AED6AEB-AEBiAIBqAIBuALJqs_RBsACAdICJDViMDM1OTBkLTJmNTktNGFmMy1hZWUzLThmYWRlYTM0NzJmM9gCAeACAQ&sid=a046e38c1a35194e6f1caf99e85173ca&dist=0&group_adults=2&group_children=0&hapos=1&hpos=1&no_rooms=1&req_adults=2&req_children=0&room1=A%2CA&sb_price_type=total&sr_order=popularity&srepoch=1781781837&srpvid=20a75024905e02f2&type=total&ucfs=1&","expediaUrl":null,"image2":null,"image3":null,"localGems":{"restaurant1":{"title":"Kronenstübli","description":"Located within the hotel, this Michelin-starred restaurant serves exquisite traditional Swiss and Italian cuisine in an elegant, cozy setting, perfect for a sophisticated evening.","affiliateLink":"https://www.thefork.com/restaurant/kronenstuebli-r602434?aff_id=STITCH"},"restaurant2":{"title":"Chesa Veglia","description":"An iconic St. Moritz institution, Chesa Veglia offers multiple dining experiences, from gourmet Italian at Heuboden to traditional Swiss at Grill, all within a vibrant, historic farmhouse setting.","affiliateLink":"https://www.opentable.com/r/chesa-veglia-st-moritz?aff_id=STITCH"},"restaurant3":{"title":"Talvo by Dalsass","description":"Housed in a charming 17th-century Engadin chalet near St. Moritz, Talvo offers Michelin-starred Mediterranean-inspired cuisine with a focus on fresh, seasonal ingredients in a refined atmosphere.","affiliateLink":"https://www.thefork.com/restaurant/talvo-by-dalsass-r602434?aff_id=STITCH"},"restaurant4":{"title":"El Paradiso","description":"A legendary mountain restaurant and club high above St. Moritz, renowned for its chic atmosphere, gourmet food, live music, and unparalleled panoramic views – the ultimate social lunch spot.","affiliateLink":"https://www.elparadiso.ch/reservations?aff_id=STITCH"}},"seasonalPrices":{"autumn":950,"spring":850,"summer":1200,"winter":2100},"youtubeUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/9yZzA4v3G8Q, https://www.youtube.com/shorts/kNQxHLljBh0, https://www.youtube.com/shorts/8Ae2mkfi0_Q, https://www.youtube.com/shorts/xDce7q_dR2E, https://m.youtube.com/shorts/wy5Tfgfmab8","priceTier":"Luxe (€€€)","primaryPersona":"The Social Weekender","primaryBackdrop":"Alpine & Peaks","is_locked":true,"updated_at":"2026-06-26T12:22:57.139+00:00"},{"id":"badrutt-s-palace-hotel","name":"Badrutt’s Palace Hotel","location":"St. Moritz, Switzerland","region":"Graubünden, Switzerland","priceCategory":"€€€€","priceValue":0,"luxuriousValue":5,"distanceValue":20,"spaScore":5,"image":"[\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/badrutt-s-palace-hotel/8.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/badrutt-s-palace-hotel/2.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/badrutt-s-palace-hotel/3.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/badrutt-s-palace-hotel/4.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/badrutt-s-palace-hotel/5.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/badrutt-s-palace-hotel/7.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/badrutt-s-palace-hotel/1.jpg\"]","imageAlt":"Badrutt’s Palace Hotel","description":"Badrutt's Palace stands as an enduring icon of alpine grandeur, offering unparalleled luxury amidst St. Moritz's breathtaking landscape. This legendary hotel marries timeless elegance with impeccable service, creating an unforgettable retreat. Expect exquisite dining, world-class amenities, and a vibrant social scene, perfect for discerning travelers.","tags":["The Epicurean Pilgrimage","Alpine Luxury","Historic Hotel","Winter Wonderland","Gourmet Dining","Ski-in/Ski-out","Lake Views"],"whyFits":["The Draw: An unparalleled culinary journey awaits, with multiple Michelin-starred and Gault&Millau recognized restaurants under one roof, satisfying the most refined palates.","The Flex: Experience the legendary King's Club, St. Moritz's most exclusive nightclub, offering a vibrant, sophisticated after-dinner scene unique in the Alps."],"tradeoff":null,"amenities":["Michelin-starred Restaurants","World-class Spa (Palace Wellness)","Indoor & Outdoor Pools","Private Ski School Access","Kids' Club","Boutiques","Tennis Courts","Ice Rink (winter)","Private Cinema","Limousine Service"],"settings":["Historic Grand Hotel","Belle Époque Architecture","Lakeside Resort","Mountain View","Elegant & Ornate Interiors"],"surroundings":"Perched majestically in the heart of St. Moritz, the hotel overlooks the stunning Lake St. Moritz and is enveloped by the majestic Engadin Alps. It offers direct access to prime skiing and hiking trails, with luxury boutiques and cultural attractions just steps away.","timeZone":"CET (Central European Time)","bookingWindow":"6-12 months in advance, especially for peak winter season and festive periods.","guestSummary":"Guests consistently rave about the impeccable, old-world service and the hotel's timeless grandeur, feeling transported to a bygone era of luxury. While some find the traditional decor a bit formal, the exceptional dining and vibrant atmosphere are universally praised.","bookingUrl":"https://www.booking.com/hotel/ch/badrutt-s-palace-st-moritz.sv.html?aid=304142&label=gen173nr-10CAQoggJCN3NlYXJjaF9iYWRydXR04oCZcyBwYWxhY2UgaG90ZWwgc3Q