ortable rooms provide a tranquil urban retreat. Experience Geneva's vibrant culture and stunning lakeside views from this perfectly situated gem.","tags":["The Urban Explorer","boutique","urban","lakeside","modern design","city break","business friendly"],"whyFits":["The Draw: Perfectly positioned for urban explorers seeking Geneva's cultural pulse and the serene beauty of Lake Geneva's shores.","The Flex: Boasts sleek, modern design and smart amenities, offering an understated luxury without the opulent price tag."],"tradeoff":null,"amenities":["Complimentary Wi-Fi","Fitness Center","Concierge Service","24-Hour Front Desk","Express Check-in/Check-out","Soundproofed Rooms"],"settings":["Urban","Boutique","Modern","City Center","Lakeside Proximity"],"surroundings":"Nestled in Geneva's vibrant city center, Hotel D is mere steps from the iconic Jet d'Eau and the serene shores of Lake Geneva. Guests are within walking distance of luxury shopping, the charming Old Town, and key business districts, offering an ideal blend of leisure and convenience.","timeZone":"CET (Central European Time)","bookingWindow":"3-6 months in advance, especially for peak season.","guestSummary":"Guests consistently praise Hotel D's exceptional location, modern aesthetic, and the friendly, attentive staff. While rooms are stylish and comfortable, some mention they can be compact, yet always impeccably clean and well-appointed.","bookingUrl":"https://www.booking.com/hotel/ch/d-geneva.en-gb.html?aid=2276744&label=msn-Mvgk9WzhifzdIJL_HsouXA-79852195012721%3Atikwd-79852383470542%3Aloc-174%3Aneo%3Amte%3Alp153565%3Adec%3Acid578497209%3Aagid1277633065034416%3Aclkid4af521a189e1179ec6084b9fe6757c21&sid=a046e38c1a35194e6f1caf99e85173ca&dest_id=-2552151&dest_type=city&dist=0&group_adults=2&group_children=0&hapos=1&hpos=1&no_rooms=1&req_adults=2&req_children=0&room1=A%2CA&sb_price_type=total&sr_order=popularity&srepoch=1782476700&srpvid=1828574c78b404bf&type=total&ucfs=1&","expediaUrl":null,"image2":null,"image3":null,"localGems":{"restaurant1":{"title":"Izumi","description":"Rooftop dining at the Four Seasons, offering exquisite Japanese-Peruvian fusion cuisine with breathtaking panoramic views of Lake Geneva and the Jet d'Eau.","affiliateLink":"https://www.fourseasons.com/geneva/dining/restaurants/izumi/?aff_id=STITCH"},"restaurant2":{"title":"Restaurant Les Armures","description":"A historic institution in Geneva's Old Town, renowned for its authentic Swiss cuisine, including delicious fondue and raclette, in a charming, traditional setting.","affiliateLink":"https://www.www.lesarmures.ch/en/restaurant/?aff_id=STITCH"},"restaurant3":{"title":"Luigia (Rive)","description":"A vibrant and popular Italian trattoria known for its authentic Neapolitan pizzas, fresh pasta, and lively atmosphere, perfect for a casual yet chic meal.","affiliateLink":"https://www.luigia.ch/en/restaurants/geneva-rive/?aff_id=STITCH"},"restaurant4":{"title":"Bistrot du Boeuf Rouge","description":"A beloved classic French bistro serving traditional dishes with a focus on high-quality meats and seasonal ingredients, offering a true taste of Parisian charm in Geneva.","affiliateLink":"https://www.bistrotboeufrouge.ch/?aff_id=STITCH"}},"seasonalPrices":{"autumn":380,"spring":350,"summer":550,"winter":300},"youtubeUrl":"","priceTier":"The Accessible Gem (€€)","primaryPersona":"The Urban Explorer","primaryBackdrop":"Lakeside Estates","is_locked":true,"updated_at":"2026-06-26T12:25:40.952+00:00"},{"id":"podere-gonzaga","name":"Podere Gonzaga","location":"Pienza, Italy","region":"Tuscany","priceCategory":"€€","priceValue":0,"luxuriousValue":4,"distanceValue":70,"spaScore":2,"image":"[\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/podere-gonzaga/1.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/podere-gonzaga/2.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/podere-gonzaga/3.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/podere-gonzaga/4.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/podere-gonzaga/5.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/podere-gonzaga/6.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/podere-gonzaga/7.jpg\"]","imageAlt":"Podere Gonzaga","description":"Podere Gonzaga is an exquisite Tuscan farmhouse, masterfully restored to offer serene luxury amidst Pienza's rolling hills. Guests revel in breathtaking views and authentic regional charm. This sanctuary promises an idyllic escape, blending rustic elegance with modern comforts for a truly sun-drenched retreat.","tags":["The Sun-Drenched Escape","TuscanVilla","Agriturismo","Countryside","InfinityPool","WineRegion","Romantic","QuietEscape","ScenicViews"],"whyFits":["The Draw: Discover an authentic Tuscan experience, where ancient charm meets modern comfort, perfect for unwinding under the Italian sun.","The Flex: Indulge in private cooking classes using fresh, local ingredients, or enjoy exclusive wine tastings overlooking the Val d'Orcia."],"tradeoff":null,"amenities":["Infinity Pool","Private Terraces","Garden","Complimentary Breakfast","Free Wi-Fi","Parking","Air Conditioning","Concierge Service","Cooking Classes (on request)","Wine Tasting (on request)"],"settings":["Historic Farmhouse","Hilltop","Vineyard Views","Olive Groves","Secluded"],"surroundings":"Nestled in the heart of Val d'Orcia, a UNESCO World Heritage site, Podere Gonzaga offers unparalleled views of Pienza and Montepulciano. It's surrounded by vineyards and olive groves, ideal for scenic walks, yet close enough to explore charming Tuscan towns.","timeZone":"CET (Central European Time)","bookingWindow":"3-6 months in advance, especially for peak season","guestSummary":"Guests consistently praise the stunning views, tranquil setting, and the warm, attentive service that makes them feel at home. Some note the remote location requires a car, which is a minor point for those seeking true seclusion.","bookingUrl":"https://www.booking.com/hotel/it/podere-gonzaga.sv.html?aid=2276744&label=msn-RZyYTuC4DvJ1MF69GGE_cQ-80401979722203%3Atikwd-80402164319011%3Aloc-174%3Aneo%3Amte%3Alp153565%3Adec%3Acid578497309%3Aagid1286429927308488%3Aclkid68cf4f1bd04c1785e7db252321837040&sid=a046e38c1a35194e6f1caf99e85173ca&dest_id=-124713&dest_type=city&dist=0&group_adults=2&group_children=0&hapos=1&hpos=1&no_rooms=1&req_adults=2&req_children=0&room1=A%2CA&sb_price_type=total&sr_order=popularity&srepoch=1782116823&srpvid=2fc63b69f65208b9&type=total&ucfs=1&","expediaUrl":null,"image2":null,"image3":null,"localGems":{"restaurant1":{"title":"Daria","description":"A beloved Pienza institution, Daria offers traditional Tuscan cuisine with a focus on local ingredients, famous for its Pici pasta and Pecorino cheese dishes. Perfect for a relaxed, authentic dinner.","affiliateLink":"https://www.thefork.it/ristorante/daria-r123456?aff_id=STITCH"},"restaurant2":{"title":"Osteria Le Logge","description":"Located in Siena, this Michelin-starred restaurant provides an exquisite fine dining experience with a contemporary take on Tuscan classics, ideal for a sophisticated evening out.","affiliateLink":"https://www.thefork.it/ristorante/osteria-le-logge-siena-r789012?aff_id=STITCH"},"restaurant3":{"title":"Trattoria Toscana I Lecci","description":"Nestled in San Quirico d'Orcia, this charming trattoria offers a rustic and genuine Tuscan culinary journey, serving hearty dishes in a warm, welcoming atmosphere.","affiliateLink":"https://www.thefork.it/ristorante/trattoria-toscana-i-lecci-r345678?aff_id=STITCH"},"restaurant4":{"title":"La Bandita Townhouse Caffe","description":"For a chic yet casual experience in Pienza, this cafe offers fresh, seasonal dishes and excellent cocktails, perfect for a leisurely lunch or sunset aperitivo.","affiliateLink":"https://www.opentable.com/r/la-bandita-townhouse-caffe-pienza?aff_id=STITCH"}},"seasonalPrices":{"autumn":400,"spring":350,"summer":550,"winter":280},"youtubeUrl":"","priceTier":"The Accessible Gem (€€)","primaryPersona":"The Sun-Drenched Escape","primaryBackdrop":"Remote Sanctuaries","is_locked":true,"updated_at":"2026-06-26T12:24:27.585+00:00"},{"id":"giardino-mountain","name":"Giardino Mountain","location":"Champfèr, Switzerland","region":"Engadin, Switzerland","priceCategory":"€€€","priceValue":0,"luxuriousValue":4,"distanceValue":20,"spaScore":5,"image":"[\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/giardino-mountain/6.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/giardino-mountain/2.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/giardino-mountain/3.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/giardino-mountain/4.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/giardino-mountain/5.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/giardino-mountain/1.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/giardino-mountain/7.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/giardino-mountain/8.jpg\"]","imageAlt":"Giardino Mountain","description":"Nestled in the breathtaking Engadin Valley, Giardino Mountain offers a sophisticated blend of Alpine charm and modern luxury. Its award-winning spa and exquisite dining create an idyllic sanctuary. Perfect for those seeking inspiration amidst stunning mountain vistas, this hotel is a true creative haven.","tags":["The Creative Retreat","Alpine Luxury","Spa Retreat","Gourmet Dining","Ski-in/Ski-out","Design Hotel","Wellness","Creative Inspiration"],"whyFits":["The Draw: A sophisticated Alpine escape offering world-class wellness, Micheli