:"https://www.thefork.com/restaurant/ecco-st-moritz-r700000?aff_id=STITCH"},"restaurant2":{"title":"Da Vittorio St. Moritz","description":"A legendary Italian culinary experience from the Cerea brothers, bringing Lombardy's finest seafood and pasta to the heart of St. Moritz.","affiliateLink":"https://www.opentable.ch/r/da-vittorio-st-moritz?aff_id=STITCH"},"restaurant3":{"title":"Chesa Veglia","description":"A historic farmhouse transformed into a culinary institution, offering three distinct restaurants: traditional Swiss, exquisite grill, and charming pizzeria.","affiliateLink":"https://www.thefork.com/restaurant/chesa-veglia-st-moritz-r700000?aff_id=STITCH"},"restaurant4":{"title":"Talvo by Dalsass","description":"A charming Engadin house hosting Martin Dalsass's celebrated Mediterranean cuisine, focusing on fresh, seasonal ingredients with an Italian flair.","affiliateLink":"https://www.thefork.com/restaurant/talvo-by-dalsass-champfer-r700000?aff_id=STITCH"}},"seasonalPrices":{"autumn":900,"spring":850,"summer":1100,"winter":1900},"youtubeUrl":"","priceTier":"Luxe (€€€)","primaryPersona":"The Creative Retreat","primaryBackdrop":"Alpine & Peaks","is_locked":true,"updated_at":"2026-06-26T12:27:26.797+00:00"},{"id":"nobu-hotel-san-sebastian","name":"Nobu Hotel San Sebastian","location":"San Sebastian, Spain","region":"Basque Country, Spain","priceCategory":"€€€","priceValue":0,"luxuriousValue":4,"distanceValue":25,"spaScore":4,"image":"[\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/nobu-hotel-san-sebastian/2.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/nobu-hotel-san-sebastian/1.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/nobu-hotel-san-sebastian/3.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/nobu-hotel-san-sebastian/4.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/nobu-hotel-san-sebastian/5.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/nobu-hotel-san-sebastian/6.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/nobu-hotel-san-sebastian/7.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/nobu-hotel-san-sebastian/8.jpg\"]","imageAlt":"Nobu Hotel San Sebastian","description":"Nobu Hotel San Sebastian blends Japanese minimalism with Basque charm, perched above the pristine La Concha Bay. Discover exquisite dining and sleek design within this sophisticated retreat. Offering unparalleled views and a vibrant atmosphere, it's perfect for stylish getaways. The hotel seamlessly merges cultural elegance with modern luxury.","tags":["The Social Weekender","Coastal","Design Hotel","Fine Dining","Bay Views","Urban Escape","Basque Culture","Luxury","Wellness","Social Scene"],"whyFits":["The Draw: Experience Nobu's signature culinary excellence and sleek design, perfectly harmonized with San Sebastian's vibrant coastal energy and gastronomic scene.","The Flex: Enjoy exclusive access to a rooftop infinity pool and bar, offering breathtaking panoramic views over La Concha Bay, ideal for social gatherings."],"tradeoff":null,"amenities":["Nobu Restaurant","Rooftop Infinity Pool","Fitness Center","Spa Treatments","Concierge Service","Room Service","Valet Parking","Private Terraces"],"settings":["Urban beachfront","Overlooking La Concha Bay","Sleek contemporary design","Boutique luxury"],"surroundings":"Nestled on the prestigious beachfront of La Concha Bay, the hotel offers immediate access to the iconic promenade and sandy shores. It's a short stroll to San Sebastian's historic Old Town (Parte Vieja), renowned for its world-class pintxos bars and cultural landmarks.","timeZone":"CET (Central European Time)","bookingWindow":"This exclusive hotel typically books out 3-6 months in advance, especially for peak season weekends and holidays.","guestSummary":"Guests consistently rave about the impeccable service, the stunning bay views from rooms and the rooftop, and the exceptional quality of the Nobu dining experience. Some note the compact room sizes, a trade-off for the prime location.","bookingUrl":"https://www.booking.com/hotel/es/nobu-san-sebastian-donostia.sv.html?aid=304142&label=gen173nr-10CAQoggJCNHNlYXJjaF9ub2J1IGhvdGVsIHNhbiBzZWJhc3RpYW4gc2FuIHNlYmFzdGlhbiwgc3BhaW5IM1gEaMgBiAEBmAEzuAEHyAEM2AED6AEB-AEBiAIBqAIBuAKGib_RBsACAdICJDg0YmJlMTQ0LWRkYjgtNDdjYy04ZDdhLWQxYzljNWUzYTE3OdgCAeACAQ&sid=a046e38c1a35194e6f1caf99e85173ca&dist=0&group_adults=2&group_children=0&hapos=1&hpos=1&no_rooms=1&req_adults=2&req_children=0&room1=A%2CA&sb_price_type=total&sr_order=popularity&srepoch=1781515403&srpvid=92034203f6840347&type=total&ucfs=1&","expediaUrl":null,"image2":null,"image3":null,"localGems":{"restaurant1":{"title":"Amelia by Paulo Airaudo","description":"A two-Michelin-starred gem offering an intimate, contemporary dining experience with innovative tasting menus in a chic setting. Perfect for a sophisticated social evening.","affiliateLink":"https://www.thefork.com/restaurant/amelia-by-paulo-airaudo-r653915?aff_id=STITCH"},"restaurant2":{"title":"Kokotxa","description":"Located in the Old Town, this Michelin-starred restaurant serves creative Basque cuisine with a modern twist in a vibrant, yet refined atmosphere. Ideal for culinary explorers.","affiliateLink":"https://www.thefork.com/restaurant/kokotxa-r456789?aff_id=STITCH"},"restaurant3":{"title":"Bodegón Alejandro","description":"A traditional Basque restaurant in the Old Town, known for its hearty, authentic dishes and a lively, welcoming ambiance. Excellent for a convivial group dinner.","affiliateLink":"https://www.thefork.com/restaurant/bodegon-alejandro-r987654?aff_id=STITCH"},"restaurant4":{"title":"La Cuchara de San Telmo","description":"A must-visit for sophisticated pintxos, offering an elevated take on the local tradition in a bustling, social environment. Expect innovative small plates and a lively crowd.","affiliateLink":"https://www.thefork.com/restaurant/la-cuchara-de-san-telmo-r123456?aff_id=STITCH"}},"seasonalPrices":{"autumn":750,"spring":650,"summer":1200,"winter":550},"youtubeUrl":"","priceTier":"Luxe (€€€)","primaryPersona":"The Social Weekender","primaryBackdrop":"Pristine Shores","is_locked":true,"updated_at":"2026-06-26T12:27:55.548+00:00"},{"id":"babette-guldsmeden","name":"Babette Guldsmeden","location":"Copenhagen, Denmark","region":"Denmark","priceCategory":"€€","priceValue":0,"luxuriousValue":4,"distanceValue":25,"spaScore":3,"image":"[\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/babette-guldsmeden/1.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/babette-guldsmeden/2.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/babette-guldsmeden/3.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/babette-guldsmeden/4.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/babette-guldsmeden/6.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/babette-guldsmeden/7.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/babette-guldsmeden/8.jpg\"]","imageAlt":"Babette Guldsmeden","description":"Babette Guldsmeden offers a unique blend of boutique charm and sustainable luxury in Copenhagen. With its bohemian-chic interiors and a focus on organic living, it provides a tranquil urban escape. Guests love the rooftop spa and vibrant courtyard, perfect for a romantic reset. It's an intimate haven amidst the city's buzz.","tags":["The Romantic Reset","Boutique","Organic","Sustainable","Rooftop Spa","Copenhagen","Nordic Charm","Romantic"],"whyFits":["The Draw: Experience Copenhagen's bohemian side with eco-conscious luxury, perfect for couples seeking a st