lection in a relaxed, elegant setting perfect for a cozy romantic evening.","affiliateLink":"https://restaurantbarr.com/?aff_id=STITCH"},"restaurant3":{"title":"Høst","description":"Renowned for its beautiful rustic-chic decor and innovative Nordic dishes, Høst provides an intimate and charming atmosphere ideal for a romantic dinner.","affiliateLink":"https://cofoco.dk/restauranter/host/?aff_id=STITCH"},"restaurant4":{"title":"Nærvæn","description":"A tiny, intimate wine bar and restaurant offering exquisite small plates and a superb wine list. Perfect for a romantic, low-key yet sophisticated culinary adventure.","affiliateLink":"https://naervaen.dk/?aff_id=STITCH"}},"seasonalPrices":{"autumn":520,"spring":480,"summer":680,"winter":380},"youtubeUrl":"","priceTier":"Boutique (€€)","primaryPersona":"The Romantic Reset","primaryBackdrop":"Iconic Cities","is_locked":true,"updated_at":"2026-06-26T12:28:13.238+00:00"},{"id":"pensiun-aldier","name":"Pensiun Aldier","location":"Sent, Switzerland","region":"Engadin, Switzerland","priceCategory":"€€","priceValue":0,"luxuriousValue":4,"distanceValue":160,"spaScore":3,"image":"[\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/pensiun-aldier/1.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/pensiun-aldier/2.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/pensiun-aldier/3.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/pensiun-aldier/4.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/pensiun-aldier/5.jpg\"]","imageAlt":"Pensiun Aldier","description":"Nestled in the historic village of Sent, Pensiun Aldier is a masterpiece of art and design, blending traditional Engadin architecture with contemporary flair. Each suite is a curated gallery, offering a serene escape amidst the stunning Swiss Alps. It's an intimate haven for discerning travelers seeking beauty and tranquility.","tags":["The Urban Explorer","Design Hotel","Art Collection","Alpine Chic","Boutique","Historic Village","Gourmet Dining"],"whyFits":["The Draw: Immerse yourself in a living art gallery, where each space is meticulously crafted, offering an unparalleled aesthetic experience in the heart of the Alps.","The Flex: Enjoy bespoke service and culinary delights, all within an architecturally stunning Engadin house, a true hidden gem for sophisticated escapists."],"tradeoff":null,"amenities":["Private Spa","Gourmet Restaurant","Art Collection","Fireplace","Terrace","Free WiFi","Parking"],"settings":["Mountain","Historic Village","Boutique","Art-focused"],"surroundings":"Pensiun Aldier is set in the picturesque, historic village of Sent, offering breathtaking views of the Lower Engadin mountains. It's a prime base for skiing, hiking, and exploring traditional Swiss culture, with easy access to regional attractions and natural beauty.","timeZone":"CET (Central European Time)","bookingWindow":"3-6 months in advance, especially for peak winter and summer seasons, due to its limited number of suites.","guestSummary":"Guests consistently rave about the exquisite design, the exceptional hospitality, and the sublime culinary experience. Some note the quiet, intimate atmosphere might not suit those seeking bustling nightlife.","bookingUrl":"https://www.booking.com/hotel/ch/pensiun-aldier.en-gb.html?aid=2276744&label=msn-zeDr7tsbbtdgzIRnHKPI2g-80264541661261%3Atikwd-80264699696712%3Aloc-174%3Aneo%3Amte%3Alp300129%3Adec%3Acid578497209%3Aagid1284230135255414%3Aclkid23595197de761d5e9bdc3ba9ae1af986&sid=a046e38c1a35194e6f1caf99e85173ca&dest_id=-2554199&dest_type=city&dist=0&group_adults=2&group_children=0&hapos=1&hpos=1&no_rooms=1&req_adults=2&req_children=0&room1=A%2CA&sb_price_type=total&sr_order=popularity&srepoch=1782476916&srpvid=884757b888880533&type=total&ucfs=1&","expediaUrl":null,"image2":null,"image3":null,"localGems":{"restaurant1":{"title":"Guarda Val","description":"A Michelin-starred restaurant offering refined Swiss cuisine with a contemporary twist, set in a charming hamlet. Perfect for a sophisticated culinary journey.","affiliateLink":"https://www.thefork.com/restaurant/guarda-val-r601099?aff_id=STITCH"},"restaurant2":{"title":"Restaurant Hotel Fex","description":"Experience authentic Engadin cuisine in a remote, stunning valley setting. A truly unique and traditional dining experience, accessible by horse-drawn carriage in winter.","affiliateLink":"https://www.opentable.com/r/hotel-fex-sils-maria?aff_id=STITCH"},"restaurant3":{"title":"Restaurant Dorta","description":"Enjoy exquisite regional dishes prepared with local ingredients in Sent itself. A cozy, elegant spot for an authentic taste of the Engadin.","affiliateLink":"https://www.thefork.com/restaurant/dorta-sent?aff_id=STITCH"},"restaurant4":{"title":"Talvo by Dalsass","description":"A legendary gastronomic institution in St. Moritz, serving exceptional Italian-Mediterranean cuisine in a historic Engadin house. A destination for serious foodies.","affiliateLink":"https://www.opentable.com/r/talvo-st-moritz?aff_id=STITCH"}},"seasonalPrices":{"autumn":600,"spring":650,"summer":780,"winter":1100},"youtubeUrl":"","priceTier":"Boutique (€€)","primaryPersona":"The Urban Explorer","primaryBackdrop":"Alpine & Peaks","is_locked":true,"updated_at":"2026-06-26T12:29:54.36+00:00"},{"id":"chesa-st-va-colani","name":"Chesa Stüva Colani","location":"Madulain, Switzerland","region":"Engadin, Switzerland","priceCategory":"€€","priceValue":0,"luxuriousValue":4,"distanceValue":190,"spaScore":3,"image":"[\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/chesa-st-va-colani/1.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/chesa-st-va-colani/2.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/chesa-st-va-colani/3.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/chesa-st-va-colani/4.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/chesa-st-va-colani/5.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/chesa-st-va-colani/6.jpg\"]","imageAlt":"Chesa Stüva Colani","description":"This historic Engadin house, reimagined as a boutique hotel, offers an intimate escape in the Swiss Alps. Blending traditional charm with contemporary comfort, it's a haven for discerning travelers seeking authentic alpine luxury. Enjoy personalized service and exquisite culinary experiences amidst breathtaking mountain vistas.","tags":["The Epicurean Pilgrimage","Boutique Hotel","Historic","Alpine","Gourmet Dining","Engadin","Switzerland","Ski Access","Hiking","Romantic"],"whyFits":["The Draw: An intimate, historic Engadin retreat offering refined alpine living and exceptional gastronomy, perfect for savoring local flavors.","The Flex: Its exclusive, award-winning restaurant, Stüva, provides an unparalleled culinary journey in a cozy, traditional setting."],"tradeoff":null,"amenities":["Gourmet Restaurant","Bar & Lounge","Ski Storage","Sauna","Steam Bath","Complimentary Wi-Fi","Parking","Concierge Service","Pet-Friendly"],"settings":["Historic Engadin House","Mountain View","Village Setting","Intimate Atmosphere","Alpine Chic"],"surroundings":"Nestled in the tranquil village of Madulain, Chesa Stüva Colani offers serene access to the Engadin Valley's pristine landscapes. It's a short drive from the vibrant resorts of St. Moritz and Zuoz, providing easy reach to world-class skiing, hiking trails, and cultural attractions.","timeZone":"CET (Central European Time)","bookingWindow":"3-6 months in advance for peak seasons, 1-2 months for off-peak.","guestSummary":"Guests consistently praise the hotel's exceptional gourmet dining experience and the warm, personalized service from the owner-hosts. Some note the quiet, secluded location, which is e