/restaurant/cotton-beach-club-r789012?aff_id=STITCH"},"restaurant4":{"title":"Can Berri Vell","description":"Discover refined Ibizan cuisine in a beautiful 17th-century farmhouse, offering an intimate and romantic dining experience.","affiliateLink":"https://www.opentable.com/r/can-berri-vell-ibiza?aff_id=STITCH"}},"seasonalPrices":{"autumn":400,"spring":350,"summer":600,"winter":250},"youtubeUrl":"","priceTier":"The Accessible Gem (€€)","primaryPersona":"The Sun-Drenched Escape","primaryBackdrop":"Exclusive Islands","is_locked":true,"updated_at":"2026-06-26T12:34:11.188+00:00"},{"id":"hotel-maria-cristina","name":"Hotel Maria Cristina","location":"San Sebastian, Spain","region":"Basque Country, Spain","priceCategory":"€€€€","priceValue":0,"luxuriousValue":5,"distanceValue":25,"spaScore":4,"image":"[\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/hotel-maria-cristina/1.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/hotel-maria-cristina/2.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/hotel-maria-cristina/3.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/hotel-maria-cristina/4.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/hotel-maria-cristina/5.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/hotel-maria-cristina/7.jpg\",\"https://beuulrcminjwggdbubfy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/stays-images/hotel-maria-cristina/8.jpg\"]","imageAlt":"Hotel Maria Cristina","description":"Hotel Maria Cristina, a Belle Époque masterpiece, stands regally by the Urumea River. It offers an opulent gateway to San Sebastian's famed gastronomy and cultural vibrancy. With impeccable service and timeless elegance, it's the perfect sanctuary for discerning travelers seeking an iconic experience.","tags":["The Epicurean Pilgrimage","Historic","Luxury","City Hot